<para>Functor.</para><para>The vector <computeroutput>x</computeroutput> contains vertex IDs from graph <computeroutput>g1</computeroutput>, and <computeroutput>y</computeroutput> contains IDs from <computeroutput>g2</computeroutput>. Both vectors will always be the same length. This implementation prints the vectors <computeroutput>w</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>y</computeroutput> to standard output. See the class definition for more information. </para>        </detaileddescription>
